{"id":"23689fb4bbf5ac96","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation.md","title":"遗传表达式的数值与序数值","display":"df-hereditary-expression-evaluation — 遗传表达式的数值与序数值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation","aliases":["72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation"],"display":"df-hereditary-expression-evaluation — 遗传表达式的数值与序数值","depends_on":["[[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]]","[[72-df-epsilon-0]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definitions5.1–5.2, print191/PDF203; ordinary-ordinal image","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"evaluation recursion and epsilon-zero closure checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditary-expression-evaluation — 遗传表达式的数值与序数值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a4bdf08ca36b4b17\" href=\"?note=a4bdf08ca36b4b17\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-base-expression\">72-df-hereditary-base-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"446dc4361d624e0f\" href=\"?note=446dc4361d624e0f\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0\">72-df-epsilon-0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definitions5.1–5.2, print191/PDF203; ordinary-ordinal image"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"evaluation recursion and epsilon-zero closure checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_h\">\\(\\mathcal E_h\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Her}_b\">\\(\\operatorname{Her}_b\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a4bdf08ca36b4b17\" href=\"?note=a4bdf08ca36b4b17\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-base-expression\">72-df-hereditary-base-expression</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j&lt;k}\\in\\mathcal E_h\">\\(E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j&lt;k}\\in\\mathcal E_h\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\omega\">\\(c\\in\\omega\\)</span>，c≥2；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"446dc4361d624e0f\" href=\"?note=446dc4361d624e0f\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0\">72-df-epsilon-0</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_c\">\\(v_c\\)</span> 和 o 按有限表达式子树递归；数值和使用自然数运算，o 中使用序数运算且有限和依 j 递增次序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,n\\in\\omega\">\\(b,n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\ge2\">\\(b\\ge2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_b\">\\(\\operatorname{ord}_b\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 为固定的自然数底数参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_c(E):=\\sum_{j&lt;k}c^{v_c(E_j)}d_j,\\qquad\no(E):=\\sum_{j&lt;k}\\omega^{o(E_j)}d_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_c(E):=\\sum_{j&lt;k}c^{v_c(E_j)}d_j,\\qquad\no(E):=\\sum_{j&lt;k}\\omega^{o(E_j)}d_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall b\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\nv_b(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n))=n,\\qquad o(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n))&lt;\\varepsilon_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall b\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\nv_b(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n))=n,\\qquad o(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n))&lt;\\varepsilon_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_b(n):=o(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ord}_b(n):=o(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限树递归使两个求值都唯一。Her 的底数展开给数值等式；序数值由有限次加法、乘有限数和 ω 指数得到，始终严格小于 ε₀。原书将其写成特定树序数，本节点取该正规表达式对应的通常序数值，不把全部结构化树序数和 von Neumann 序数混为同一类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-hereditary-base-expression","status":"resolved","id":"a4bdf08ca36b4b17","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0","status":"resolved","id":"446dc4361d624e0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hereditary-base-expression","status":"resolved","id":"a4bdf08ca36b4b17","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_h$ 与 $\\operatorname{Her}_b$ 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]]；$E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j<k}\\in\\mathcal E_h$。$c\\in\\omega$，c≥2；$\\varepsilon_0$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-0]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0","status":"resolved","id":"446dc4361d624e0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_h$ 与 $\\operatorname{Her}_b$ 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]]；$E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j<k}\\in\\mathcal E_h$。$c\\in\\omega$，c≥2；$\\varepsilon_0$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-0]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Her}_b","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\langle\\langle E_j,d_j\\rangle\\rangle_{j<k}\\in\\mathcal E_h","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"v_c","display":false},{"tex":"b,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"v_c(E):=\\sum_{j<k}c^{v_c(E_j)}d_j,\\qquad\no(E):=\\sum_{j<k}\\omega^{o(E_j)}d_j.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall b\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\nv_b(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n))=n,\\qquad o(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n))<\\varepsilon_0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_b(n):=o(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)).","display":true}],"bytes":2023,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"d0e3fa6d930415cd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$2\\le b\\le c<\\omega$，$n\\in\\omega$；$v_c,\\operatorname{Her}_b$ 使用 [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-501","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"}],"outgoing":["a4bdf08ca36b4b17","446dc4361d624e0f"]}